<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-New CEO for Financial Planning Association.</title>
<headline>RTRS-New CEO for Financial Planning Association.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Financial Planning Association of Australia (FPA) said on Thursday David Butcher had been appointed chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Butcher, who will take up the position on January 13, was currently director, strategic communications with Telstra Corporation and formerly worked for the Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd, the associaton said in a statement.</p>
<p>He replaces Jock Rankin, who resigned it August, it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom  61-2 9373-1800</p>
